Binary tree where 

-> all levels are full except last level. Last level is left filled

-> children have priority greater than that of the parent

Note: min-heap is where root is the smallest max-heap is reversed with the property all nodes are smaller than their parent.

------------------------------------------
Binary heaps can be stored in an array. Given a node at index i its parent is at floor(i/2). 

Given a node at i its left child is at 2i and its right child is at (2i + 1)

